---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">/ 03 Speaking</div>
        <h2 class="serif" style="margin-top: 12px;">On stage, on the mic.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Talks, podcast appearances, and the occasional rant disguised as a meetup.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="talk-card">
      <div class="talk-thumb" data-talk-thumb role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play talk">
        <img
          src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/lrtkB5UjdEQ/maxresdefault.jpg"
          alt="Kevin Holler · Talk thumbnail"
          style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.85;"
        />
        <div class="talk-thumb-overlay">
          <div class="talk-play"><Icon name="play" size={28} /></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="talk-meta">
        <div class="eyebrow">Featured · Conference talk</div>
        <h3>From idea to production: shipping AI features without breaking your users.</h3>
        <p>A walkthrough of the patterns I've seen work in real teams — eval harnesses, dark launches, feature-flagged rollouts, and the unglamorous bits of putting LLMs in front of real customers.</p>
        <div class="talk-stats">
          <span>YouTube</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>~32 min</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>English</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const thumb = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-talk-thumb]');
  const load = () => {
    if (!thumb || thumb.dataset.loaded) return;
    thumb.dataset.loaded = '1';
    thumb.innerHTML = `<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lrtkB5UjdEQ?autoplay=1" title="Kevin Holler · Talk" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen style="border:0;width:100%;height:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;"></iframe>`;
  };
  thumb?.addEventListener('click', load);
  thumb?.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
      e.preventDefault();
      load();
    }
  });
</script>
